            "<html lang=\"en\">\n<body>\n\t<p>Now, let's talk more about obesity and how it is triggered to give you a good idea of what obesity means and some of\n    the key factors affecting its development.</p>\n\n<h2>What is obesity?</h2>\n<p>Obesity is a chronic disease - a long-lasting condition - that can reduce your quality of life, according to the World Health Organization. Obesity and being overweight occur when your body fat increases above \"normal\" levels.\n    Here, the body mass index, or BMI, is often used as a general guide:</p>\n\n<!-- images/bmi.svg -->\n<svg width=\"390\" height=\"455\" viewBox=\"0 0 390 455\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n    <rect width=\"390\" height=\"455\" fill=\"white\"/>\n    <path d=\"M39.34 51.98L39.5 51.74C40.4333 51.7533 41.2267 51.88 41.88 52.12C42.5467 52.36 43.0533 52.7267 43.4 53.22C43.76 53.7133 43.94 54.3467 43.94 55.12C43.94 55.92 43.7467 56.6133 43.36 57.2C42.9733 57.7733 42.3867 58.22 41.6 58.54C40.8133 58.8467 39.8267 59 38.64 59H32.8V57.76L34.7 57.26L34.36 57.76V46.26L34.78 46.8L32.8 46.3V45.06L36.72 44.96H38.92C39.8933 44.96 40.7133 45.0867 41.38 45.34C42.0467 45.5933 42.5533 45.98 42.9 46.5C43.2467 47.0067 43.42 47.6467 43.42 48.42C43.42 49.4733 43.0867 50.3 42.42 50.9C41.7533 51.4867 40.7267 51.8467 39.34 51.98ZM38.44 46.7H36.42L36.82 46.32V51.34L36.42 50.98H37.98C38.58 50.98 39.1 50.9067 39.54 50.76C39.98 50.6133 40.32 50.38 40.56 50.06C40.8133 49.7267 40.94 49.2933 40.94 48.76C40.94 48.2533 40.8333 47.8533 40.62 47.56C40.42 47.2533 40.1333 47.0333 39.76 46.9C39.3867 46.7667 38.9467 46.7 38.44 46.7ZM38.44 57.24C39.04 57.24 39.5667 57.1667 40.02 57.02C40.4733 56.86 40.82 56.6133 41.06 56.28C41.3133 55.9467 41.44 55.5067 41.44 54.96C41.44 54.4267 41.3267 53.9933 41.1 53.66C40.8867 53.3267 40.5933 53.0867 40.22 52.94C39.8467 52.7933 39.42 52.72 38.94 52.72H36.42L36.82 52.28V57.64L36.42 57.24H38.44ZM50.6734 48.14C52.2201 48.14 53.4201 48.6067 54.2734 49.54C55.1401 50.46 55.5734 51.7